      "text": "A page from a CVSource (投中信息) Chinese-language investment-research report headed \"A轮交易占市场近半数 广东投资数量荣登榜首\" (A-round deals are nearly half the market; Guangdong leads on deal count). Two donut charts compare deal count and deal size by round for H1 2024, and a horizontal bar chart below ranks the top ten regions -- Guangdong 647 deals against 5967.1, Jiangsu 646, Shanghai 493, Zhejiang 417, Beijing 388.",
